FAIL {id,error,code} with a known code is an error reply
FAIL {id,error} without code is a protocol violation
ok   unknown code is a protocol violation
ok   extra key in an error reply
FAIL id null with parse_error (request not read)
ok   id null with bad_request
ok   error reply with a foreign id
FAIL invalid snapshot → transport failure instead of an engine error: bad reply fields ['code', 'error']
